            "heading": "The Aim.",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_KBXpzy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Welcome to our collection of contemporary pre-loved pieces. We are a mother and daughter team with the shared belief in slowing down the shopping process by extending the lifetime of fashion already in existence. We launched in April 2020 and our aim' is to make you fall in love with second hand fashion, hence our motto 'preloved at first sight.' We want the shopping experience for buying second hand clothes to be one that is luxurious without compromising on style. Buying luxury doesn't always mean buying new!</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
