      "blocks": {
        "text_MjBpBn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Mother.</h2><p></p><p>I'm Karen and absolutely love working with my daughter Danielle. I've had over 20 years of experience in the fashion industry. I've been working in fashion and textiles after my grandparents journey began in the early 1960s exporting fabrics across the globe. There has always been a stigma attached to buying second hand but I've recently noticed the shift in attitude. I absolutely love browsing second hand charity shops and finding a hidden treasure but we wanted to create an online platform that offers a more luxurious and less time consuming experience. A lot of the existing platforms are still really expensive and we aim to sell unique pieces at prices that are really affordable. We came up with the idea of My Circular Wardrobe in January 2020 and launched our website in April!</p><p>​</p><p></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_MjBpBn"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-02-27_at_16.31.35.png",
