      "blocks": {
        "text_4j7wce": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Daughter.</h2><p> </p><p>I'm Danielle and like my mum I've had nearly 10 years of experience working in fashion. I've always loved selling clothes. I used to co-run an annual fashion event teamed with Grazia magazine selling discounted designer brands with the proceeds going to charity. I later joined my mum in supplying luxurious sustainable fabrics to designer brands. I've been listing my unwanted clothes on Ebay for over 15 years. I've never wanted anything go to waste though sometimes it's a little extreme! It did take me a while to buy second hand myself and at first I couldn't believe my glamorous mother was shopping in charity shops back in 2017. She changed my perception by presenting me with the beautiful pieces she discovered and making me guess the price. With the belief in second hand fashion and with my experience in selling it made so much sense for us to launch My Circular Wardrobe.</p><h3><strong>​</strong></h3><h2><strong>Our Collection.</strong></h2><p> </p><p>Our focus is creating a collection of sought after pieces. Our collection features everything from high street to designer brands including Zara, Ganni, Whistles, & Other Stories, Me+Em, Maje, Prada, Alexander Mcqueen, Jimmy Choo, Christian Louboutin and more.</p><p> </p><p>We hope that you fall in love with these pieces as much as we do! </p><p> </p><p>We hope to encourage you to join our circular fashion movement and buy pre-loved.</p><p>​</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
